WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
The world suddenly doesn't

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.200
care about the war in Ukraine.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.600
I actually experienced this.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.100
We recently published a video

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.633
about drone warfare

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:08.500
in the war in Ukraine,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.500
and it was one of the more

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.933
ambitious videos I've ever made,

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:12.733
and yet it like flopped.

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:14.200
And I don't have videos flop

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.033
very often, this is weird.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:17.200
And I was scratching my head

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.366
until I started to realize

00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:19.266
that the world

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:21.133
is losing interest in this war.

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:21.766
Like, this was like

00:00:21.766 --> 00:00:24.200
the focus of the entire world for years.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.600
Western people and governments

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.766
have been pouring money

00:00:26.766 --> 00:00:27.400
and attention

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.033
and support on Ukraine

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:30.600
since Russia invaded.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.066
But now

00:00:31.066 --> 00:00:32.533
governments are debating whether or not

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:33.533
they should give any money

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.100
or weapons to Ukraine anymore.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.200
People have turned their attention

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.166
to other things.

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.900
The war in Israel is pulling people's

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:39.600
attention away.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.700
Global conflict

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.566
really relies on global attention.

00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:45.133
A conflict like the war in Ukraine

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.200
could be won or lost based on

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.833
how much we pay attention to it,

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:50.033
how much we pressure our government

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:51.333
to continue to support it.

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.133
That support seems to be waning

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.533
and the people of Ukraine

00:00:54.533 --> 00:00:56.633
and their leaders are pretty nervous.

00:00:56.633 --> 00:00:57.600
If you want to better understand

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.633
global politics, follow along for more.

